.TH ENGINE_POP 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_pop \- Queue removal of the top scene
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "void engine_pop(Engine *e);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queue removal of the top scene. Its on_exit runs when applied. A scene may pop itself. When the last scene is popped the loop ends.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_push (3),
.BR engine_replace (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
